---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Base title="Actualités et agenda — ARB Réunion">
  <Header current="agenda" />
  <main class="w-full pt-20 bg-surface min-h-[calc(100vh-80px)]"><div class="flex flex-col w-full">
<!-- 1. HERO & À LA UNE SECTION -->
<section class="page-hero relative w-full pt-space-lg pb-28 md:pb-36 overflow-hidden">
<div class="w-full max-w-[1380px] mx-auto px-gutter-mobile md:px-gutter lg:px-margin relative z-10">
<!-- Eyebrow & Page Intro -->
<div class="flex flex-col max-w-3xl mb-space-lg">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs mb-space-xs">
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-secondary-container text-primary-container font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider">
<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-surface-tint animate-pulse"></span>
            Observatoire &amp; Diffusion
          </span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary">Édition Océan Indien • Saint-Denis</span>
</div>
<h1 class="font-display-lg text-display-lg text-primary-container tracking-tight leading-tight mb-space-xs">
          Actualités, Agenda &amp; Formations
        </h1>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl">
          Vivez au rythme de la préservation de la biodiversité réunionnaise : rendez-vous de terrain, webinaires, formations et actualités scientifiques.
    </p>
  </div>
<!-- Grand Bloc "À la Une" (Bento Hero Feature) -->
<div class="w-full rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-xl overflow-hidden group">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 min-h-[460px]">
<!-- Image Split Column -->
<div class="lg:col-span-7 relative min-h-[300px] lg:min-h-full overflow-hidden">
<div class="w-full h-full bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-105" data-alt="Nocturnal coastal landscape of Réunion island under a starry sky, seabird silhouette Petrel de Barau gliding in deep ultramarine and dark basalt tones, ambient warm coastal glow in soft paper teal and deep lagoon mist." style="background-image: url('https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBkNS8KqJPgKnHsVa2JzZWNGfuq4_uUIdilE_SOFwGZyqNmHu1-7QdKJ4yJcw9QC70rnKO3Qe8t5KacEGFddiO4CgM2_8of4nJiDzPHGi8XrBo--rZRdM5uHmkEClmhMIvXYefvB-hW-yn1ASXlfZKD2ISZdm2fnRU6rLcs_gNlByJ7QcxNb5jEb_yo_lHOwagZFVYahZ_VPUTBI0HZR7iUcChPlKa3R6cWdAU2EhVp')"></div>
<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t lg:bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-container/90 via-primary-container/40 to-transparent"></div>
<!-- Badges Floating on Image -->
<div class="absolute top-space-md left-space-md flex flex-wrap items-center gap-space-xs">
<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-tertiary-container text-on-tertiary font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest flex items-center gap-1 shadow-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">campaign</span>
                Événement Majeur Péi
              </span>
<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface/90 backdrop-blur-md text-primary-container font-label-sm text-label-sm flex items-center gap-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[15px]">nest_eco_leaf</span>
                Conservation Prioritaire
              </span>
</div>
<!-- Image Caption Metadata Bottom Left -->
<div class="absolute bottom-space-md left-space-md hidden sm:flex items-center gap-2 text-inverse-on-surface/90 font-label-sm text-label-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">visibility</span>
<span>Campagne Insulaire 2025 • Massif du Piton des Neiges &amp; Littoral</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Content Split Column -->
<div class="lg:col-span-5 p-space-md lg:p-space-lg flex flex-col justify-between bg-surface-container-lowest">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-secondary font-label-md text-label-md mb-space-xs">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">calendar_month</span>
<span>Du 10 au 30 Avril 2025</span>
<span>•</span>
<span class="text-tertiary-container font-bold">J-42 avant lancement</span>
    </div>
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface leading-tight mb-space-sm group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Les Nuits Sans Lumière 2025 : protégeons l'envol des jeunes pétrels de Barau
              </h2>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-space-md">
                Coordonnée avec l'ensemble des 24 communes et acteurs institutionnels, la 17ᵉ édition invite citoyens, entreprises et collectivités à éteindre leurs éclairages nocturnes pour éviter l'échouage fatal des oiseaux marins endémiques.
              </p>
<!-- Mini metrics pill list -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-space-xs p-space-sm bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg mb-space-md">
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-display-lg text-[24px] leading-tight text-primary-container font-bold">+1 200</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary">Pétrels secourus en 2024</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-display-lg text-[24px] leading-tight text-primary-container font-bold">24 / 24</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary">Communes engagées</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- CTAs -->
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-space-sm pt-space-xs">
<a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-space-lg py-3 rounded-full bg-primary-container text-inverse-on-surface font-label-lg text-label-lg hover:bg-primary transition-all shadow-md hover:shadow-lg" href="#">
<span>Découvrir le programme &amp; agir</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">arrow_forward</span>
</a>
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-space-md py-3 rounded-full text-primary-container hover:bg-secondary-container/40 font-label-lg text-label-lg transition-colors" href="#">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">download</span>
<span>Kit communication</span>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 w-full overflow-hidden leading-none">
<svg class="block h-12 w-full fill-current text-surface md:h-20" preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 1440 96">
<path d="M0,32 C280,96 520,0 840,48 C1160,96 1360,16 1440,32 L1440,96 L0,96 Z"></path>
</svg>
</div>
</section>
<!-- 2. SEARCH ENGINE & FILTERS SECTION -->
<section class="relative z-20 -mt-px w-full bg-surface pb-space-lg">
<div class="w-full max-w-[1380px] mx-auto px-gutter-mobile md:px-gutter lg:px-margin">
<!-- Search Box Card -->
<div class="w-full bg-surface-container rounded-lg p-space-md shadow-md mb-space-lg">
<!-- Text Input & Date Pickers -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-space-sm mb-space-sm" data-protonpass-form="">
<!-- Text search with autocomplete simulation -->
<div class="md:col-span-7 lg:col-span-8 relative">
<label class="sr-only" for="search-news">Rechercher une actualité ou un événement</label>
<div class="relative flex items-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined absolute left-4 text-secondary text-[22px]">search</span>
<input class="w-full pl-12 pr-10 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface placeholder-on-surface-variant/60 font-body-md text-body-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary shadow-inner" id="search-news" placeholder="Mot-clé, espèce, lieu péi, formation (ex: Pétrel, Mare Longue, Trames vertes)..." type="text">
<button class="absolute right-3.5 text-secondary hover:text-on-surface" id="agenda-clear" title="Effacer la recherche" type="button">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">cancel</span>
</button>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Date / Month Filter -->
<div class="md:col-span-5 lg:col-span-4 relative">
<div class="relative flex items-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined absolute left-4 text-secondary text-[20px]">event</span>
<select class="w-full appearance-none pl-11 pr-10 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface font-label-md text-label-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary cursor-pointer shadow-inner" id="agenda-period">
<option value="all">Toutes les périodes (2024 - 2025)</option>
<option value="now">Ce mois-ci (Novembre 2024)</option>
<option value="dec24">Décembre 2024</option>
<option value="jan25">Janvier 2025</option>
<option value="s1_25">1er Semestre 2025</option>
</select>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined absolute right-4 text-secondary pointer-events-none text-[20px]">expand_more</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Filter Row 1: Content Type Chips -->
<div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-space-sm pt-space-xs border-t border-outline-variant/30">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs flex-wrap" id="agenda-types">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase text-secondary font-bold mr-1">Type :</span>
<button type="button" data-kind="" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary-container text-on-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm shadow-sm">Tout</button>
<button type="button" data-kind="actualites" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface hover:bg-secondary-container transition-colors font-label-sm text-label-sm">Actualités</button>
<button type="button" data-kind="evenements" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface hover:bg-secondary-container transition-colors font-label-sm text-label-sm">Événements grand public</button>
<button type="button" data-kind="formations" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface hover:bg-secondary-container transition-colors font-label-sm text-label-sm">Formations pro</button>
<button type="button" data-kind="appels" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface hover:bg-secondary-container transition-colors font-label-sm text-label-sm">Appels à projets</button>
</div>
<div class="text-right">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary" id="agenda-count">
<strong>7</strong> résultats affichés
            </span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Filter Row 2: Ecological Thematics -->
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs flex-wrap pt-space-xs mt-space-xs" id="agenda-themes">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase text-secondary font-bold mr-1">Thématiques :</span>
<button type="button" data-theme="marin" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-secondary-fixed transition-colors font-label-sm text-label-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">waves</span>
            Milieu marin &amp; récifs
          </button>
<button type="button" data-theme="forets" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-secondary-fixed transition-colors font-label-sm text-label-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">forest</span>
            Forêts péi
          </button>
<button type="button" data-theme="menaces" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-secondary-fixed transition-colors font-label-sm text-label-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">warning</span>
            Espèces menacées
          </button>
<button type="button" data-theme="amenagement" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-secondary-fixed transition-colors font-label-sm text-label-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">solar_power</span>
            Aménagement durable
          </button>
<button type="button" data-theme="reglementation" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-secondary-fixed transition-colors font-label-sm text-label-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">gavel</span>
            Réglementation
          </button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- 3. RECENT NEWS GRID SECTION -->
<section class="relative w-full bg-surface pb-24 md:pb-32">
<div class="w-full max-w-[1380px] mx-auto px-gutter-mobile md:px-gutter lg:px-margin">
<!-- Section Title & Sub-heading -->
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-space-sm mb-space-lg">
<div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-surface-tint font-bold">Dernières publications</span>
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary-container leading-none">
            Les Dépêches de la Biodiversité
          </h2>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-secondary">Trier par :</span>
<button type="button" id="sort-recent" class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold underline underline-offset-4">Plus récentes</button>
<span class="text-secondary">•</span>
<button type="button" id="sort-views" class="font-label-md text-label-md text-secondary hover:text-on-surface">Les plus consultées</button>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Articles Grid (4 required featured items + editorial richness) -->
<div class="grid gap-space-md mb-space-lg [grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,17rem),1fr))]" id="news-grid">
<!-- Article 1: Orchidée Sainte-Rose -->
<article data-item data-kind="actualites" data-period="now" data-themes="forets menaces" data-date="2024-11-06" data-views="640" class="flex flex-col bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group">
<div class="relative h-52 overflow-hidden">
<div class="w-full h-full bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" data-alt="Macro botanical photography of a rare endemic wild orchid clinging to mossy basalt tree bark in the mist of Sainte-Rose rain forest La Réunion, delicate pale petals and deep emerald moss in soft natural diffuse light." style="background-image: url('https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDHenKIchPkvn8p8vhjW9diVsONxhDkrIa1_EK47b5OLnR0DILqhHvDN4-USWEbSsrze6AYRhyNbvZ3YCg6bGsdcKIkND0KIyXG5uDocyEOp6qzDpM-wfrIVcmjOJuNpUUXExMKXjfcnKK9g1fKjFkPmuxtWpCisWsI2U32ukiuGrGYA5vfjwV6AX_vuVu-qXTFPZo2K9ENOTl8oblU8gpwwUq3mzHZvrZElnYo3tsh')"></div>
<div class="absolute top-3 left-3">
<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-secondary-container text-primary-container font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold shadow-sm">
                Botanique &amp; Découverte
              </span>
</div>
<div class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-surface/90 backdrop-blur-md text-on-surface font-label-sm text-label-sm flex items-center gap-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">schedule</span>
<span>4 min</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-space-md flex flex-col flex-1 justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-secondary font-label-sm text-label-sm mb-space-xs">
<span>06 Nov 2024</span>
<span>•</span>
<span>Hauts de Sainte-Rose</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface group-hover:text-primary transition-colors leading-snug mb-space-xs">
                Découverte d'une nouvelle station d'orchidée endémique dans les hauts de Sainte-Rose
              </h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant line-clamp-3 mb-space-sm">
                Les équipes botaniques du CBNM et du Parc national ont confirmé la localisation d'une colonie saine de 45 individus d'Angraecopsis, réputée disparue de ce versant humide.
              </p>
</div>
<div class="pt-space-xs border-t border-surface-variant/40 flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary font-bold inline-flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">
                Lire l'article <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">east</span>
</span>
<button class="text-secondary hover:text-primary" title="Partager">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">share</span>
</button>
</div>
</div>
</article>
<!-- Article 2: Tortues vertes Ouest -->
<article data-item data-kind="actualites" data-period="now" data-themes="marin" data-date="2024-11-02" data-views="910" class="flex flex-col bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group">
<div class="relative h-52 overflow-hidden">
<div class="w-full h-full bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" data-alt="Aerial ocean and golden sand shoreline shot at Saint-Leu La Réunion showing turquoise lagoon coral barrier and green sea turtle Chelonia mydas tracks emerging onto warm volcanic sand." style="background-image: url('https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAteWeme2_bBKhkYRMDFCO4TnksJuP9n2aWzMHvPFX9ANBNVbYJrVsTQcdCIIumY6x6QYsDn4QacgOD50ho8F7tVW2URbujINZAPV6eOaR-3vZR17-DhHyLdY4cOLJZwnyubgVFwgEDlD3tq8xtLRYVqh7_Q4wrvqSEgsv4r2OVbUXQGjJ10jsZRp2Gn68CydMOlOTSHG4jXOYxnxB52MtB81fH7aZ_kg_NdWz7b9Tb')"></div>
<div class="absolute top-3 left-3">
<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary-fixed text-on-primary-fixed font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold shadow-sm">
                Milieu Marin
              </span>
</div>
<div class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-surface/90 backdrop-blur-md text-on-surface font-label-sm text-label-sm flex items-center gap-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">schedule</span>
<span>5 min</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-space-md flex flex-col flex-1 justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-secondary font-label-sm text-label-sm mb-space-xs">
<span>02 Nov 2024</span>
<span>•</span>
<span>Littoral Ouest</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface group-hover:text-primary transition-colors leading-snug mb-space-xs">
                Bilan de la saison de ponte des tortues vertes sur le littoral ouest
              </h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant line-clamp-3 mb-space-sm">
                L'observatoire Kélonia enregistre un record décennal d'émergences accompagnées à Saint-Gilles et la Saline, fruit d'un réaménagement anti-pollution lumineuse.
              </p>
</div>
<div class="pt-space-xs border-t border-surface-variant/40 flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary font-bold inline-flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">
                Lire l'article <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">east</span>
</span>
<button class="text-secondary hover:text-primary" title="Partager">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">share</span>
</button>
</div>
</div>
</article>
<!-- Article 3: Atlas papillons Réunion -->
<article data-item data-kind="actualites" data-period="" data-themes="menaces" data-date="2024-10-28" data-views="1200" class="flex flex-col bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group">
<div class="relative h-52 overflow-hidden">
<div class="w-full h-full bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" data-alt="Scientific editorial illustration and high-definition photography of an endemic butterfly of Réunion island Salamis augustina resting on indigenous lush foliage, scientific entomology style with warm paper background tones." style="background-image: url('https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDReu8unUmh4wINtSY1W35luwk8nbrMksXZrgE0ivb0XPqYh8pAhwKxVBVQOXyPpTe2_kcAgS4_vxBLDq1VLKKaoF-Of_JiCwfxyIT6pFoOtfdKcrERVv6cY8bWocQHOSIFZxSZolyKgteMIpAhRTb_PZnjr-ey9AutXqGV76K5OntLo3ikIeONoIk6bhdwAjOkhEWJkn8uOh4ou5O_s62_Y2fbIooikQ4V8jnMAz26')"></div>
<div class="absolute top-3 left-3">
<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold shadow-sm">
                Publication Scientifique
              </span>
</div>
<div class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-surface/90 backdrop-blur-md text-on-surface font-label-sm text-label-sm flex items-center gap-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">schedule</span>
<span>6 min</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-space-md flex flex-col flex-1 justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-secondary font-label-sm text-label-sm mb-space-xs">
<span>28 Oct 2024</span>
<span>•</span>
<span>Édition ARB Réunion</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface group-hover:text-primary transition-colors leading-snug mb-space-xs">
                Publication du nouvel atlas des papillons de La Réunion
              </h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant line-clamp-3 mb-space-sm">
                Fruit de 8 années de prospections collaboratives, ce guide de 280 pages détaille la répartition, l'écologie et le statut de menace des 32 espèces diurnes de l'île.
              </p>
</div>
<div class="pt-space-xs border-t border-surface-variant/40 flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary font-bold inline-flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">
                Lire l'article <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">east</span>
</span>
<button class="text-secondary hover:text-primary" title="Partager">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">share</span>
</button>
</div>
</div>
            </article>
<!-- Article 4: Formation Ripisylves -->
